1
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:18,260
♪If I am gone from this world,
will the dark night collapse?♪

2
00:00:18,880 --> 00:00:25,820
♪If I never return
to guard by your side♪

3
00:00:26,270 --> 00:00:30,800
♪If I seal away our encounter
and erase all trace♪

4
00:00:31,010 --> 00:00:33,900
♪Like endless snow
falling into the deep sea♪

5
00:00:34,050 --> 00:00:40,350
♪This life is but a fleeting illusion,
yet it gave me courage♪

6
00:00:40,510 --> 00:00:41,740
♪Love is a miracle♪

7
00:00:41,740 --> 00:00:42,920
=Spring Over Phoenix Pond=

8
00:00:42,920 --> 00:00:45,300
(Adapted from Qin An'an's
"Spring Over Phoenix Pond")

9
00:00:45,340 --> 00:00:48,260
=Episode 6=

10
00:00:49,390 --> 00:00:52,030
I pray with a balanced diet in life,

11
00:00:52,030 --> 00:00:54,070
so just please
don't let me marry Qi Zhao.

12
00:00:58,070 --> 00:00:59,560
Our engagement is already set,

13
00:00:59,960 --> 00:01:01,200
yet you're here praying for love?

14
00:01:01,790 --> 00:01:02,840
Is that any of your business?

15
00:01:03,320 --> 00:01:04,710
Wow, that's a guan of money.

16
00:01:06,040 --> 00:01:08,150
Are you that eager to marry me?

17
00:01:10,200 --> 00:01:11,120
I'm praying for the water in your head

18
00:01:11,120 --> 00:01:12,230
to drain out quickly,

19
00:01:12,230 --> 00:01:13,560
so you won't act like a fool all day.

20
00:01:13,560 --> 00:01:14,200
Wait,

21
00:01:14,640 --> 00:01:15,350
what did you say?

22
00:01:15,350 --> 00:01:16,150
Say that again.

23
00:01:16,150 --> 00:01:17,350
I said you act like a fool.

24
00:01:17,680 --> 00:01:19,230
I gave you face today, didn't I?

25
00:01:19,230 --> 00:01:19,840
So what? Come at me.

26
00:01:19,840 --> 00:01:20,560
- You...
- Miss Xiang.

27
00:01:30,590 --> 00:01:31,350
Miss Xiang,

28
00:01:31,510 --> 00:01:32,790
your grandmother is looking for you.

29
00:01:33,120 --> 00:01:33,950
I'll take you there.

30
00:01:34,040 --> 00:01:34,680
Let's go.

31
00:01:46,040 --> 00:01:47,040
Jin?

32
00:02:05,480 --> 00:02:06,200
Jin.

33
00:02:14,080 --> 00:02:15,150
Why are you dressed like this?

34
00:02:15,680 --> 00:02:18,960
I heard you were here praying today

35
00:02:18,960 --> 00:02:19,870
with Miss Xiang.

36
00:02:21,310 --> 00:02:21,870
I...

37
00:02:22,870 --> 00:02:24,280
I just wanted to see you.

38
00:02:25,840 --> 00:02:27,310
Then I am satisfied.

39
00:02:29,870 --> 00:02:30,520
Jin,

40
00:02:32,400 --> 00:02:33,000
don't go.

41
00:02:37,710 --> 00:02:38,360
Zhao,

42
00:02:40,430 --> 00:02:41,400
this might be

43
00:02:43,430 --> 00:02:45,590
the last time we see each other.

44
00:02:47,840 --> 00:02:48,560
Why?

45
00:02:50,240 --> 00:02:51,310
Mother found a group

46
00:02:51,310 --> 00:02:52,870
of crude men from the countryside,

47
00:02:53,520 --> 00:02:54,710
and she wants to marry me off.

48
00:02:56,800 --> 00:02:58,520
Mr. Zheng is already arranging
matches for me.

49
00:02:59,470 --> 00:03:00,680
I have no choice.

50
00:03:01,080 --> 00:03:01,630
Zhao,

51
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:03,560
I just wanted to see you one last time.

52
00:03:04,960 --> 00:03:05,840
I won't allow it.

53
00:03:06,400 --> 00:03:07,280
I'm going to confront them.

54
00:03:07,910 --> 00:03:08,430
Zhao.

55
00:03:13,280 --> 00:03:14,520
We are only brother and sister.

56
00:03:16,240 --> 00:03:18,400
I am destined to marry someone else.

57
00:03:18,910 --> 00:03:20,710
Brother and sister...

58
00:03:20,710 --> 00:03:22,430
I hate those words the most.

59
00:03:23,150 --> 00:03:24,710
We aren't related by blood at all.

60
00:03:29,750 --> 00:03:31,030
Since we aren't related by blood,

61
00:03:31,470 --> 00:03:32,430
as long as you marry me,

62
00:03:32,470 --> 00:03:33,750
we can be together forever.

63
00:03:37,470 --> 00:03:39,000
Father and Mother won't agree.

64
00:03:39,960 --> 00:03:40,910
Are you willing?

65
00:03:41,520 --> 00:03:42,400
If you are,

66
00:03:42,520 --> 00:03:44,240
I would brave any hardship
to make you my wife.

67
00:03:54,910 --> 00:03:55,710
Young Lady Qi,

68
00:03:56,030 --> 00:03:57,310
I need to go find my grandmother.

69
00:03:58,840 --> 00:04:00,520
The flowers near
the tearoom are in full bloom.

70
00:04:00,710 --> 00:04:01,750
Let's go take a look together.

71
00:04:03,520 --> 00:04:05,430
Who knows what scheme

72
00:04:05,800 --> 00:04:07,240
you Qis are cooking up again?

73
00:04:11,150 --> 00:04:11,960
Miss Xiang,

74
00:04:12,470 --> 00:04:13,430
you overthink things.

75
00:04:14,080 --> 00:04:15,680
It's hot outside right now.

76
00:04:15,870 --> 00:04:17,510
Your grandmother is advanced in years.

77
00:04:17,720 --> 00:04:20,240
The tearoom
is the perfect place to rest.

78
00:04:22,630 --> 00:04:23,480
Grandmother.

79
00:04:26,600 --> 00:04:27,920
Who permitted you to speak to her?

80
00:04:29,040 --> 00:04:30,190
You've only been back for a few days.

81
00:04:30,270 --> 00:04:31,270
What rules do you know?

82
00:04:31,310 --> 00:04:33,480
If you ruin the alliance between
the Marquis Residence and the Xiangs,

83
00:04:33,600 --> 00:04:34,680
can you take responsibility for it?

84
00:04:34,870 --> 00:04:35,680
Grandmother,

85
00:04:36,190 --> 00:04:38,870
why don't we go
to the tearoom to enjoy the flowers?

86
00:04:39,390 --> 00:04:40,830
The scenery is much better over there.

87
00:04:41,040 --> 00:04:42,680
You can also rest and drink tea,

88
00:04:42,830 --> 00:04:43,920
so you won't suffer in the sun.

89
00:04:45,680 --> 00:04:46,360
All right,

90
00:04:46,480 --> 00:04:47,510
let's go.

91
00:04:50,160 --> 00:04:50,680
Come, Grandmother.

92
00:04:50,680 --> 00:04:51,270
Yes, that's right.

93
00:04:51,270 --> 00:04:52,920
Come, let me assist you over to rest.

94
00:04:53,040 --> 00:04:53,800
I'll support you.

95
00:04:53,800 --> 00:04:54,270
Let's go.

96
00:04:54,510 --> 00:04:54,920
Let's go.

97
00:05:01,720 --> 00:05:02,270
Zhao...

98
00:05:04,360 --> 00:05:04,950
Zhao...

99
00:05:05,950 --> 00:05:06,920
Only this way

100
00:05:07,870 --> 00:05:09,560
can we be together forever.

101
00:05:26,870 --> 00:05:27,720
Zhao...

102
00:05:37,480 --> 00:05:38,390
Slow down.

103
00:05:38,600 --> 00:05:39,800
Madam, mind the step.

104
00:05:39,800 --> 00:05:40,360
Alright.

105
00:05:43,720 --> 00:05:44,390
Zhao...

106
00:05:44,800 --> 00:05:45,160
Zhao...

107
00:05:48,830 --> 00:05:49,920
Don't call me Zhao.

108
00:05:50,600 --> 00:05:51,390
Call me...

109
00:05:53,480 --> 00:05:54,360
Call me husband.

110
00:06:01,040 --> 00:06:01,510
Madam,

111
00:06:01,920 --> 00:06:03,360
it seems this room

112
00:06:03,480 --> 00:06:04,750
is already occupied.

113
00:06:04,750 --> 00:06:06,630
Let me take you somewhere else to rest.

114
00:06:06,630 --> 00:06:07,310
Wait.

115
00:06:09,120 --> 00:06:10,600
Zhao, you're naughty.

116
00:06:11,160 --> 00:06:12,270
Call me husband.

117
00:06:12,390 --> 00:06:14,240
Why does that voice

118
00:06:14,720 --> 00:06:15,870
sound so familiar?

119
00:06:15,920 --> 00:06:17,560
Like I've heard it somewhere before.

120
00:06:18,510 --> 00:06:19,360
Husband.

121
00:06:19,750 --> 00:06:20,430
Jin,

122
00:06:21,240 --> 00:06:22,870
I want to be with you forever.

123
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:36,600
What if it's someone we know?

124
00:06:36,600 --> 00:06:38,270
It wouldn't be good to disturb them.

125
00:06:38,480 --> 00:06:39,360
Let's go, Madam.

126
00:06:39,480 --> 00:06:40,750
- Let's go.
- Zhao, you naughty boy.

127
00:06:42,000 --> 00:06:42,800
Jin,

128
00:06:43,310 --> 00:06:44,870
I want to stay with you forever.

129
00:06:45,680 --> 00:06:46,600
It's Qi Zhao!

130
00:06:48,430 --> 00:06:49,120
Rong...

131
00:06:50,000 --> 00:06:50,510
Madam.

132
00:06:51,040 --> 00:06:51,510
Madam.

133
00:06:52,800 --> 00:06:53,310
You...

134
00:06:56,270 --> 00:06:57,680
Who is it?

135
00:07:00,240 --> 00:07:01,040
Mother?

136
00:07:04,190 --> 00:07:05,190
Why are you here?

137
00:07:06,070 --> 00:07:07,310
What are you doing?

138
00:07:07,600 --> 00:07:09,120
How could you do such a thing?

139
00:07:09,920 --> 00:07:11,120
Mother,

140
00:07:11,950 --> 00:07:13,630
Jin is mine now.

141
00:07:13,630 --> 00:07:15,720
I want to marry her
with a proper ceremony.

142
00:07:15,920 --> 00:07:17,750
Shut up! Don't even dream of it.

143
00:07:17,920 --> 00:07:19,190
Mother,

144
00:07:19,190 --> 00:07:21,000
Jin and I are really in love.

145
00:07:21,120 --> 00:07:22,190
I never wanted to engage

146
00:07:22,190 --> 00:07:23,040
to anyone in the Xiang family.

147
00:07:23,160 --> 00:07:24,310
Grant us your blessing,

148
00:07:24,310 --> 00:07:25,430
please.

149
00:07:25,600 --> 00:07:26,430
Aren't Qi Jin and Qi Zhao

150
00:07:26,430 --> 00:07:27,680
siblings?

151
00:07:28,390 --> 00:07:29,800
If he breaks off the engagement
with Xiang Rong,

152
00:07:30,000 --> 00:07:31,720
who else would discuss
marriage with the Qi family?

153
00:07:31,720 --> 00:07:33,720
Young Master, stop talking nonsense.

154
00:07:34,190 --> 00:07:36,600
We only came to pray
for blessings together.

155
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:38,600
What engagement are you talking about?

156
00:07:39,120 --> 00:07:39,720
Rong,

157
00:07:40,240 --> 00:07:41,040
let's go.

158
00:07:42,270 --> 00:07:43,480
What kind of mess is this?

159
00:07:44,950 --> 00:07:46,800
Oh, good Heavens!

160
00:07:46,870 --> 00:07:48,750
What sin have I committed?

161
00:07:48,750 --> 00:07:49,190
You...

162
00:07:49,720 --> 00:07:50,160
It's all because of you,
butcher's daughter...

163
00:07:50,160 --> 00:07:51,310
Calm down, Mother.

164
00:07:51,630 --> 00:07:53,480
Your mother swapped the babies

165
00:07:53,480 --> 00:07:54,510
and took my daughter away.

166
00:07:54,830 --> 00:07:57,160
- Now you come to ruin my son!
- Mother.

167
00:07:57,160 --> 00:07:58,240
They aren't real siblings?

168
00:07:59,240 --> 00:08:00,870
You are ruining my son!

169
00:08:00,870 --> 00:08:01,560
Mother!

170
00:08:02,040 --> 00:08:02,390
You...

171
00:08:03,000 --> 00:08:03,920
Mother.

172
00:08:05,190 --> 00:08:05,750
Mother.

173
00:08:07,040 --> 00:08:08,680
Mother!

174
00:08:09,070 --> 00:08:10,270
Let me take you back first, Mother.

175
00:08:11,560 --> 00:08:12,160
Careful.

176
00:08:32,550 --> 00:08:33,790
Have you ever heard

177
00:08:35,360 --> 00:08:37,270
the phrase "an eye for an eye"?

178
00:08:46,870 --> 00:08:48,080
Back at the estate,

179
00:08:48,910 --> 00:08:50,720
when you used such despicable means

180
00:08:50,720 --> 00:08:51,870
to humiliate me,

181
00:08:52,510 --> 00:08:53,790
did you ever think

182
00:08:54,630 --> 00:08:55,910
this day would come for you?

183
00:09:10,480 --> 00:09:11,270
Do you admit your mistake?

184
00:09:11,440 --> 00:09:11,840
I did nothing wrong.

185
00:09:11,840 --> 00:09:12,790
Still talk back?

186
00:09:12,790 --> 00:09:13,240
I did nothing wrong.

187
00:09:13,240 --> 00:09:13,910
- Do you admit it or not?
- Dear...

188
00:09:13,910 --> 00:09:14,790
I did nothing wrong!

189
00:09:14,790 --> 00:09:15,870
Stop beating him, dear.

190
00:09:15,870 --> 00:09:17,240
Stop, dear.

191
00:09:17,240 --> 00:09:19,360
Zhao is our only son.

192
00:09:19,360 --> 00:09:21,440
You'll kill him if you keep beating him.

193
00:09:21,440 --> 00:09:21,960
Yuan,

194
00:09:22,150 --> 00:09:22,790
tell him.

195
00:09:23,080 --> 00:09:24,080
Tell him what he did wrong.

196
00:09:25,270 --> 00:09:27,120
His Majesty has long
intended to reduce noble titles.

197
00:09:27,240 --> 00:09:29,150
Father sought this marriage
with the Xiangs

198
00:09:29,320 --> 00:09:31,600
because they enjoy the Emperor's favor

199
00:09:31,600 --> 00:09:32,630
and military glory.

200
00:09:33,320 --> 00:09:35,080
Father wants to rely on
the Xiang family's influence

201
00:09:35,600 --> 00:09:37,150
to secure the Qi family's noble title.

202
00:09:38,320 --> 00:09:39,360
Look at what you did.

203
00:09:40,270 --> 00:09:41,630
You broke the betrothal
with the Xiang family

204
00:09:41,840 --> 00:09:43,240
and ruined our family's reputation

205
00:09:43,240 --> 00:09:44,120
throughout the capital!

206
00:09:44,670 --> 00:09:46,200
If the Emperor finds out about this,

207
00:09:46,240 --> 00:09:47,720
we will lose our noble title altogether.

208
00:09:47,720 --> 00:09:48,630
I don't care about the title.

209
00:09:48,750 --> 00:09:49,600
I only want Jin.

210
00:09:49,910 --> 00:09:50,790
- You still talking back?
- Master.

211
00:09:50,790 --> 00:09:51,200
Stop.

212
00:09:51,200 --> 00:09:51,870
Don't hit him anymore.

213
00:09:51,870 --> 00:09:53,750
You'll hurt the young master
if you keep beating him.

214
00:09:53,910 --> 00:09:54,200
Zhao,

215
00:09:54,200 --> 00:09:54,960
lock him up.

216
00:09:54,960 --> 00:09:55,390
Say no more.

217
00:09:55,390 --> 00:09:56,390
Reflect on your actions.

218
00:09:56,390 --> 00:09:57,550
Only release him

219
00:09:57,870 --> 00:09:58,750
when he comes to his senses.

220
00:09:59,390 --> 00:09:59,790
Dear.

221
00:10:04,750 --> 00:10:05,510
Young Lady,

222
00:10:05,910 --> 00:10:07,600
if we just let
Second Young Lady off like this,

223
00:10:07,600 --> 00:10:09,550
won't she try to harm you?

224
00:10:10,270 --> 00:10:11,120
Let her off?

225
00:10:11,790 --> 00:10:13,910
She lost the Qi family's
most precious possession.

226
00:10:14,000 --> 00:10:15,910
I doubt she can even keep her life.

227
00:10:15,960 --> 00:10:17,000
What possession?

228
00:10:21,670 --> 00:10:23,390
You've shamed the Qis.

229
00:10:23,670 --> 00:10:24,910
I cannot let you live today.

230
00:10:41,120 --> 00:10:42,150
Prince Qi.

231
00:10:46,440 --> 00:10:48,120
How dare you poison me?

232
00:10:48,630 --> 00:10:50,320
I treated you with sincerity,

233
00:10:50,630 --> 00:10:53,270
yet you killed me
on the eve of my enthronement.

234
00:10:56,270 --> 00:10:57,360
This time,

235
00:10:58,720 --> 00:11:01,510
don't even think
about escaping my hands.

236
00:11:14,740 --> 00:11:19,380
♪How I wish to hold
onto this fleeting warmth♪

237
00:11:19,760 --> 00:11:23,540
♪How I wish to live
this life only for you♪

238
00:11:24,050 --> 00:11:29,510
♪When memories sink
and the heart settles♪

239
00:11:29,730 --> 00:11:33,890
♪Forgetting life, death,
parting, and reunion♪

240
00:11:34,680 --> 00:11:38,960
♪How I wish to stay
only in the moment with you♪

241
00:11:39,760 --> 00:11:46,660
♪Anchoring myself by your side♪
